			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Revert ESBuild configuration to standard syntax and regenerate bridge shapes\n\nRevert the ESBuild configuration files in `Configuration/ESBuild` and `Source/ESBuild.js` to standard, readable JavaScript syntax. Remove aggressive minification, variable obfuscation (single-letter identifiers), and dense inline formatting that was previously applied to the build pipeline.\n\nSimultaneously, regenerate all 16 `*BridgeShapeGenerated.ts` files across the `Source/Effect` workbench services. Restore multi-line formatting for the `Pick<>` type declarations, expanding single-line type lists into readable, indented blocks. This change prioritizes code maintainability and clarity over build artifact density, ensuring the build configuration and generated TypeScript contracts align with standard development practices.\n\nThe bridge shapes for services including UserSettings, WorkbenchActivity, WorkbenchEditor, and WorkbenchStorage are now formatted with explicit line breaks for each method in the type union.",
